  "description": {
    "en": "HEAD HAWK TOUCH is a high-performance co-polyester monofilament designed for advanced Tour and tournament players who demand exceptional control, touch and accurate feedback. Its Crystal Core Technology uses a complex multistep heat-treatment process to create a larger crystalline inner core, allowing HEAD to precisely tune the balance between control and elasticity. The result is a highly predictable string with excellent feel, directional precision and a versatile response for high-level competitive tennis.",

    "zh": "HEAD HAWK TOUCH 是一款面向高级、巡回赛及比赛型球员的高性能共聚酯单丝球线，核心特点是极高的控制力、触球感和精准反馈。其 Crystal Core Technology 采用复杂的多阶段热处理制造工艺，通过形成更大的结晶内核来精确调节球线的力量与控制平衡。最终带来高度稳定、精准且具有优秀击球反馈的表现，非常适合挥拍速度快、需要精确掌控每一次击球的高水平球员。"
  },

